{
 "esm": "1.3.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "cmeps_aoflux",
  "description": "CMEPS atmosphere-ocean bulk flux component (stage 2 of the EqESM project): the pointwise laws of flux_atmOcn_large in cesm/flux_atmocn/flux_atmocn_Large.F90 (the Large & Pond / Large & Yeager scheme of the CESM mediator, cesm3.0-alphabranch checkout) transcribed exactly, with the expression templates of ./cmeps_templates.esm imported by reference. The traced configuration (the C_JRA_t62 DATM+MOM6 case, nuopc.runconfig of the instrumented run): add_gusts = .false., coldair_outbreak_mod = .false., aofluxes_use_shr_wv_sat = .true. (the shr_wv_sat Goff & Gratch / qsat path), minwind = 0.5 m/s (seq_flux_atmocn_minwind), flux_convergence = 0.01 and flux_max_iteration = 5 (the do-while of F90:242-290). Structure, in the order of the Fortran: (a) the 12 raw inputs zbot/ubot/vbot/thbot/qbot/rainc/rbot/tbot/pslv/us/vs/ts (the flux_atmOcn_large argument list, F90:50-67); (b) the derived inputs of F90:193-229: du = ubot - us and dv = vbot - vs (the relative-wind components), vmag (the minwind-clamped relative wind), wind0 = vmag (the resolved wind of F90:204; with add_gusts = .false. the Fortran computes wind0 = max(minwind, sqrt(du^2 + dv^2)) identically to vmag, so the alias is exact), esat_raw (Goff & Gratch at ts), esat = min(esat_raw, pslv), qsat from the RAW es (shr_wv_sat_qsat_liquid calls svp_to_qsat with the unminned es, shr_wv_sat_mod.F90:439-441), ssq = 0.98*qsat, delt, delq, alz = ln(zbot/10), al2 = ln(zref/ztref), cp = cpdair*(1 + cpvir*ssq), with the CESM constants cpdair = 1004.64 J/kg/K and cpvir = 1810/1004.64 - 1 declared once as named parameters of this component (shr_const_mod.F90:46, 48); (c) the neutral coefficients of F90:236-244 (stable0 = 0.5 + sign(0.5, delt) as a 0/1 selection, rdn0 = sqrt(cdn(vmag)), rhn0 = (1-stable0)*0.0327 + stable0*0.018, ren0 = 0.0346, ustar0/tstar0/qstar0); (d) the stability iteration of F90:242-290. The esm has no loop construct, so the iteration is represented compositionally: the 16-equation update law is authored ONCE in the one-step model AoFluxStep of ./cmeps_aoflux_step.esm (a single pass of the do-while: hol_raw (the unclamped Monin-Obukhov parameter of F90:252-253), hol = stability_parameter_clamp(hol_raw) (the |hol| <= 10 sign-preserving clamp of F90:254), the stability selection, xsq/xqq, the psi functions, the clamped wind-shift rdw of F90:272, u10n = vmag*rdw/rdn_prev, the updated neutral coefficients rdn = sqrt(cdn(u10n)) and rhn, the height-shifted rd/rh/re of F90:282-284, ustar/tstar/qstar, the per-update convergence flag conv = |(ustar - ustar_prev)/ustar| <= 0.01, and 4 frozen-state fields (ustar/tstar/qstar/rdn) pinning the first-converged state) and mounted six times by reference as top-level models step1..step5 and exit (esm-spec section 4.7; top-level mounts are required because the pinned CLI silently drops couplings in the single-top-level-model build path, see README-cmeps.md), with the chained inputs coupled by variable_map: ustar0/tstar0/qstar0/rdn0 seed step1, each step's state feeds the next (ustar/tstar/qstar/rdn), conv and the 4 frozen fields thread the convergence state, and the fixed pointwise fields vmag/delt/delq/alz/zbot/thbot/qbot feed every step (ren stays the constant 0.0346 of F90:277, not coupled; the CESM constants karman = 0.4, cpdair, cpvir, latvap = 2.501e6 J/kg and stebol = 5.67e-8 W/m^2/K^4 are declared once as named parameters of this component, shr_const_mod.F90:32, 46, 48, 52, 22). The 6th mount exit recomputes the exit-state fields from step5's frozen state: the exit-state fields of the first-converged update k are deterministic functions of the pre-converged state (the update k-1 outputs ustar/tstar/qstar/rdn) plus the fixed fields (Fortran do-while trace), so only these 4 states need to be threaded — exit is fed by step5.frozen_ustar_prev/frozen_tstar_prev/frozen_qstar_prev/frozen_rdn_prev (conv_prev stays at its 0 default, so the frozen selection inside exit is the identity) and the 7 fixed fields, and the parent aliases the 15 exit-state fields from its fresh unknowns (hol, stable, xsq, xqq, psimh, psixh, rd, u10n, rdn, rhn, rh, re, ustar, tstar, qstar), which coincide bit-identically with the Fortran exit state. The parent keeps the same external names as the pre-refactor unrolled model so the pinned tests are unchanged: conv_1..4 = step1..4.conv, iter = the first converged k, else 5 (nested ifelse on conv_1..4), and the 16 exit-state fields = the 15 exit.* fields (the first-converged update's values, recomputed by the exit mount from the pinned 4-state; in the no-convergence case the fresh 5th-update values) plus ren; (e) the fluxes of F90:299-311 (tau/taux/tauy/sen/lat/lwup/evap); (f) the 2-m diagnostics of F90:316-333 (hol2/xsq2/xqq2/psix2/fac_t/fac_q/tref/qref/duu10n/u10res), which consume the exit state exactly as the Fortran leaves it after the do-while."
 },
 "models": {
  "AoFlux": {
   "expression_template_imports": [
    { "ref": "./cmeps_templates.esm" }
   ],
   "variables": {
    "zbot": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "default": 10.0,
     "description": "height of the lowest atmosphere model level (F90:56), [m]"
    },
    "ubot": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m/s",
     "default": -2.5053703459796655,
     "description": "zonal wind at zbot (F90:57), [m/s]"
    },
    "vbot": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m/s",
     "default": 1.0523198010187174,
     "description": "meridional wind at zbot (F90:58), [m/s]"
    },
    "thbot": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "K",
     "default": 271.666139623882,
     "description": "potential temperature at zbot (F90:59), [K]"
    },
    "qbot": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "kg/kg",
     "default": 0.0020241880033025007,
     "description": "specific humidity at zbot (F90:60), [kg/kg]"
    },
    "rainc": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "kg/m^2/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "convective rain for the gustiness term (F90:61); unused in the traced configuration (add_gusts = .false.) and dumped as 0 after the mediator's 1-element dummy allocation was exposed as an out-of-bounds read (bugs.md #28), [kg/m2/s]"
    },
    "rbot": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "kg/m^3",
     "default": 1.2777012762287812,
     "description": "density of air at zbot (F90:62), [kg/m3]"
    },
    "tbot": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "K",
     "default": 271.666139623882,
     "description": "temperature at zbot (F90:63); part of the flux_atmOcn_large interface but not consumed by the physics in this configuration, [K]"
    },
    "pslv": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "Pa",
     "default": 99756.84487865833,
     "description": "sea level pressure (F90:64), [Pa]"
    },
    "us": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "zonal ocean surface current (F90:65), [m/s]"
    },
    "vs": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "meridional ocean surface current (F90:66), [m/s]"
    },
    "ts": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "K",
     "default": 275.0527096440321,
     "description": "ocean surface temperature (F90:67), [K]"
    },
    "karman": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.4,
     "description": "von Karman constant = 0.4 (shr_const_mod.F90:32), the exchange-coefficient denominator of fac_t/fac_q (F90:321, 324); the AoFluxStep mounts carry the same constant as an uncoupled parameter (the ren precedent), [-]"
    },
    "cpdair": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "J/kg/K",
     "default": 1004.64,
     "description": "specific heat of dry air = 1004.64 J/kg/K (shr_const_mod.F90:46), the cp = cpdair*(1 + cpvir*ssq) of F90:226, [J/kg/K]"
    },
    "cpvir": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.8016403885969103,
     "description": "molecular-weight ratio cpvir = 1810/1004.64 - 1 (shr_const_mod.F90:48), the cp correction of F90:226, [-]"
    },
    "latvap": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "J/kg",
     "default": 2501000.0,
     "description": "latent heat of vaporization = 2.501e6 J/kg (shr_const_mod.F90:52, loc_latvap of F90:305), the lat and evap scale of F90:305/308, [J/kg]"
    },
    "stebol": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "W/m^2/K^4",
     "default": 5.67e-08,
     "description": "Stefan-Boltzmann constant = 5.67e-8 W/m^2/K^4 (shr_const_mod.F90:22), the lwup = -stebol*ts^4 of F90:306, [W/m2/K4]"
    },
    "du": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "zonal relative wind du = ubot - us (F90:193), [m/s]"
    },
    "dv": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "meridional relative wind dv = vbot - vs (F90:193), [m/s]"
    },
    "vmag": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "wind magnitude used in the iteration (F90:193-196): the relative wind sqrt(du^2 + dv^2) floored at minwind = 0.5 m/s; with add_gusts = .false. no gustiness is added; coupled to every AoFluxStep mount, [m/s]"
    },
    "wind0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "resolved wind without the gustiness addition (F90:204): with add_gusts = .false. the Fortran computes wind0 = max(minwind, sqrt(du^2 + dv^2)) identically to vmag, so the alias wind0 = vmag is exact, [m/s]"
    },
    "ugust": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "convective gustiness term ugust(min(rainc, 6.94444e-4)) (F90:197-202); identically 0 in the traced configuration (add_gusts = .false.), [m/s]"
    },
    "esat_raw": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "Pa",
     "description": "saturation vapor pressure at ts from the Goff & Gratch (1946) liquid-water formula (shr_wv_sat_mod.F90:942-956, the aofluxes_use_shr_wv_sat = .true. branch of F90:217-225), BEFORE the min(es, pslv) cap of shr_wv_sat_qsat_liquid, [Pa]"
    },
    "esat": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "Pa",
     "description": "esat = min(esat_raw, pslv) (shr_wv_sat_qsat_liquid, shr_wv_sat_mod.F90:439-441), [Pa]"
    },
    "qsat": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/kg",
     "description": "saturation specific humidity qs = epsilo*es/(p - omeps*es) with the p <= es guard from the RAW es (shr_wv_sat_svp_to_qsat is called with the unminned es, shr_wv_sat_mod.F90:351-363, 439-441), [kg/kg]"
    },
    "ssq": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/kg",
     "description": "sea surface humidity = 0.98*qsat (F90:221), [kg/kg]"
    },
    "delt": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "K",
     "description": "potential temperature difference thbot - ts (F90:223); coupled to every AoFluxStep mount, [K]"
    },
    "delq": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/kg",
     "description": "specific humidity difference qbot - ssq (F90:224); coupled to every AoFluxStep mount, [kg/kg]"
    },
    "alz": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "ln(zbot/zref) with zref = 10 m (F90:225); coupled to every AoFluxStep mount, [-]"
    },
    "al2": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "ln(zref/ztref) with zref = 10 m, ztref = 2 m (F90:321), [-]"
    },
    "cp": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "J/kg/K",
     "description": "specific heat of moist air cp = cpdair*(1 + cpvir*ssq) (F90:226, shr_const cpvir = 1810/1004.64 - 1), [J/kg/K]"
    },
    "stable0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "first-estimate stability factor stable = 0.5 + sign(0.5, delt) (F90:237): 1 stable (delt >= 0), 0 unstable, [-]"
    },
    "rdn0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "neutral 10-m sqrt drag coefficient sqrt(cdn(vmag)) (F90:238); seeds step1.rdn_prev, [-]"
    },
    "rhn0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "neutral 10-m sqrt heat coefficient (1 - stable0)*0.0327 + stable0*0.018 (F90:239), [-]"
    },
    "ren0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "neutral 10-m sqrt water coefficient = 0.0346 (F90:240), [-]"
    },
    "ustar0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "first-estimate friction velocity rdn0*vmag (F90:242); seeds step1.ustar_prev, [m/s]"
    },
    "tstar0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "K",
     "description": "first-estimate friction temperature rhn0*delt (F90:243); seeds step1.tstar_prev, [K]"
    },
    "qstar0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/kg",
     "description": "first-estimate friction humidity ren0*delq (F90:244); seeds step1.qstar_prev, [kg/kg]"
    },
    "conv_1": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "convergence flag of update 1 = step1.conv (the 1st mount of the AoFluxStep update law): |(ustar_1 - ustar0)/ustar_1| <= flux_convergence = 0.01 (the Fortran exit test of F90:286-287 after update 1), 1 converged / 0 not, [-]"
    },
    "conv_2": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "convergence flag of update 2 = step2.conv: |(ustar_2 - ustar_1)/ustar_2| <= 0.01 (F90:286-287), 1 converged / 0 not, [-]"
    },
    "conv_3": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "convergence flag of update 3 = step3.conv: |(ustar_3 - ustar_2)/ustar_3| <= 0.01 (F90:286-287), 1 converged / 0 not, [-]"
    },
    "conv_4": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "convergence flag of update 4 = step4.conv: |(ustar_4 - ustar_3)/ustar_4| <= 0.01 (F90:286-287), 1 converged / 0 not, [-]"
    },
    "iter": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "iteration count of the converged state = the first k <= 4 with conv_k = 1, else 5 (the Fortran do-while of F90:242-290 runs until the exit test passes, at most flux_max_iteration = 5), [-]"
    },
    "hol": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "exit-state Monin-Obukhov stability parameter at zbot = step5.frozen_hol (the value the Fortran leaves in hol when the do-while exits: the first-converged update's value, pinned and carried unchanged through the remaining updates by the frozen-state threading; dumped pre-2m-rescale as the hol column), [-]"
    },
    "stable": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "exit-state stability factor = step5.frozen_stable (F90:255), 1 stable / 0 unstable, [-]"
    },
    "xsq": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "exit-state sqrt(|1 - 16*hol|) floored at 1 = step5.frozen_xsq (F90:256), [-]"
    },
    "xqq": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "exit-state sqrt(xsq) = step5.frozen_xqq (F90:257), [-]"
    },
    "psimh": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "exit-state momentum stability function at zbot = step5.frozen_psimh (F90:258), [-]"
    },
    "psixh": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "exit-state scalar stability function at zbot = step5.frozen_psixh (F90:259), [-]"
    },
    "rd": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "exit-state sqrt momentum exchange coefficient at zbot = step5.frozen_rd (F90:282), [-]"
    },
    "u10n": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "exit-state 10-m neutral wind = step5.frozen_u10n (F90:273), [m/s]"
    },
    "rdn": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "exit-state neutral 10-m sqrt drag coefficient = step5.frozen_rdn (F90:276), [-]"
    },
    "rhn": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "exit-state neutral 10-m sqrt heat coefficient = step5.frozen_rhn (F90:278), [-]"
    },
    "ren": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "neutral 10-m sqrt water coefficient = 0.0346, constant across the iteration (F90:277), [-]"
    },
    "rh": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "exit-state sqrt heat exchange coefficient at zbot = step5.frozen_rh (F90:283), [-]"
    },
    "re": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "exit-state sqrt water exchange coefficient at zbot = step5.frozen_re (F90:284), [-]"
    },
    "ustar": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "exit-state friction velocity rd*vmag = step5.frozen_ustar (F90:286), [m/s]"
    },
    "tstar": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "K",
     "description": "exit-state friction temperature rh*delt = step5.frozen_tstar (F90:287), [K]"
    },
    "qstar": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/kg",
     "description": "exit-state friction humidity re*delq = step5.frozen_qstar (F90:288), [kg/kg]"
    },
    "tau": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "N/m^2",
     "description": "wind stress magnitude rbot*ustar^2 (F90:299), [N/m2]"
    },
    "taux": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "N/m^2",
     "description": "zonal wind stress tau*du/vmag (F90:301), [N/m2]"
    },
    "tauy": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "N/m^2",
     "description": "meridional wind stress tau*dv/vmag (F90:302), [N/m2]"
    },
    "sen": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "W/m^2",
     "description": "sensible heat flux cp*tau*tstar/ustar (F90:304), [W/m2]"
    },
    "lat": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "W/m^2",
     "description": "latent heat flux latvap*tau*qstar/ustar (F90:305, loc_latvap = 2.501e6 J/kg), [W/m2]"
    },
    "lwup": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "W/m^2",
     "description": "upward longwave flux -stebol*ts^4 (F90:306, stebol = 5.67e-8), [W/m2]"
    },
    "evap": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/m^2/s",
     "description": "evaporative water flux lat/latvap (F90:308), [kg/m2/s]"
    },
    "hol2": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "stability parameter at the 2-m reference height hol*ztref/zbot with ztref = 2 m (F90:317), [-]"
    },
    "xsq2": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "sqrt(|1 - 16*hol2|) floored at 1 (F90:318), [-]"
    },
    "xqq2": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "sqrt(xsq2) (F90:319), [-]"
    },
    "psix2": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "scalar stability function at the 2-m reference height (F90:320), [-]"
    },
    "fac_t": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "temperature interpolation factor (rh/karman)*(alz + al2 - psixh + psix2) with al2 = ln(zref/ztref) (F90:321), [-]"
    },
    "fac_q": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "humidity interpolation factor (re/karman)*(alz + al2 - psixh + psix2) (F90:324), [-]"
    },
    "tref": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "K",
     "description": "2-m reference air temperature thbot - delt*fac_t - 0.01*ztref (F90:322-323, the 0.01 K/m potential-to-actual temperature correction), [K]"
    },
    "qref": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/kg",
     "description": "2-m reference specific humidity qbot - delq*fac_q (F90:325), [kg/kg]"
    },
    "duu10n": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^2/s^2",
     "description": "10-m neutral wind squared u10n^2 (F90:329), [m2/s2]"
    },
    "u10res": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "10-m resolved wind (gust-free) u10n*wind0/vmag (F90:330), [m/s]"
    }
   },
   "equations": [
    {
     "lhs": "du",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "-",
      "args": [
       "ubot",
       "us"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "dv",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "-",
      "args": [
       "vbot",
       "vs"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "vmag",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "max",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "sqrt",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "+",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "^",
            "args": [
             "du",
             {
              "op": "const",
              "args": [],
              "value": 2.0,
              "units": "1"
             }
            ]
           },
           {
            "op": "^",
            "args": [
             "dv",
             {
              "op": "const",
              "args": [],
              "value": 2.0,
              "units": "1"
             }
            ]
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "const",
        "args": [],
        "value": 0.5,
        "units": "m/s"
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "wind0",
     "rhs": "vmag"
    },
    {
     "lhs": "ugust",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "const",
      "args": [],
      "value": 0.0,
      "units": "m/s"
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "esat_raw",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "apply_expression_template",
      "args": [],
      "name": "goff_gratch_liquid_svp",
      "bindings": {
       "t": "ts"
      }
     }
